Phasmid: Network Information and the network Client Hints

What:     navigator.connection.effectiveType, rtt and downlink and the ECT,
          RTT and Downlink Client Hints report network.connection, fixed for
          the session. Stock's per-host noise stays but is keyed on the
          profile seed, so JavaScript and every header agree for a host.
Why:      The estimator follows the host's real network, and stock salts the
          browser and each renderer separately, so its header and JS differ.
Profile:  network.connection.effective_type, network.connection.rtt,
          network.connection.downlink, seed
Hooks:    services/network/public/cpp/network_quality_tracker.cc
          NetworkQualityTracker constructor, OnNetworkQualityChanged;
          content/browser/client_hints/client_hints.cc GetRandomMultiplier;
          third_party/blink/renderer/platform/network/network_state_notifier.cc
          NetworkStateNotifier::GetRandomMultiplier; BUILD.gn deps
Contexts: main, iframe, worker, shared worker, service worker, headers
          (worker requests carry no network hints, as in stock)
Guard:    tests/guards/network/connection.py

